{"number":112,"bismillahHeader":true,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"ar":"قُلْ هُوَ اللّٰهُ اَحَدٌ ۝١ۚ","tr":"Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One,"},{"n":2,"ar":"اَللّٰهُ الصَّمَدُ ۝٢ۚ","tr":"Allah, the Eternal Refuge."},{"n":3,"ar":"لَمْ يَلِدْ࣢ۙ وَلَمْ يُوْلَدْ ۝٣ۙ","tr":"He neither begets nor is born,"},{"n":4,"ar":"وَلَمْ يَكُنْ لَّهٗ كُفُوًا اَحَدٌ ۝٤ࣖ","tr":"Nor is there to Him any equivalent.\""}]}